Anthropic has made its Claude cowork agent available on both mobile phones and web browsers.

00:03:55.740 --> 00:04:00.720
The agent keeps working on a task even after you close your laptop or switch devices.

00:04:01.440 --> 00:04:07.060
It sends a notification when it needs your input on the next decision. This is useful when you want

00:04:07.060 --> 00:04:13.100
help that does not pause just because you leave the desk. To try it yourself, open the Claude app on

00:04:13.100 --> 00:04:18.860
your phone or visit the Claude site in a browser and look for the co-work option if it shows in your

00:04:18.860 --> 00:04:25.220
area. A simple first test is to give it a longer creative request such as planning a weekend story with

00:04:25.220 --> 00:04:30.960
three characters and then step away while it keeps building the outline. Come back later to see the

00:04:30.960 --> 00:04:36.960
progress and decide what comes next. That same spirit of helpful tools that fit into every day

00:04:36.960 --> 00:04:43.580
life shows up in another recent release. Solos just launched a new version of its air-go smart glasses

